      "hints": [
        "The top of the file becomes an `if`/`else` on `expenses.Count == 0`, followed by `PrintRejected(rejected);`.",
        "Find the largest with `expenses.OrderByDescending(e => e.Amount).First()`. Only call it, and `Average`, inside `PrintSummary`, which never runs for an empty list.",
        "The last line is `$\"Largest: {largest.Amount:N2} ({largest.Category}, {largest.Date:yyyy-MM-dd})\"`."
      ]
