      "hints": [
        "Group by `e.Date.ToString(\"yyyy-MM\")`. The key is already the text you want to print.",
        "Sort the groups with `.OrderBy(g => g.Key)` and turn each into `new SummaryRow(g.Key, g.Sum(e => e.Amount))`.",
        "`PrintTable` holds the three things both sections share: `Console.WriteLine();`, `Console.WriteLine(heading);` and the `foreach` over the rows. `PrintByCategory` then ends with `PrintTable(\"By category\", rows);`."
